```powershell
Verify whether the creator still has active membership in the safe and what permissions they hold:

$pvwaURL = 'https://<pvwa>'
$headers = @{Authorization = "Bearer $token"}
Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$pvwaURL/PasswordVault/API/Safes/<safeUrlId>/Members" -Headers $headers | Select-Object -ExpandProperty Members | Where-Object {$_.MemberName -eq '<creatorName>'}
```
